[Pertanyaan]: Which of the following is NOT mentioned as a component of smart grid technology?','[{"key": "A", "text": "Sensors"}, {"key": "B", "text": "Manual operator controls"}, {"key": "C", "text": "Digital technology"}, {"key": "D", "text": "Advanced data analytics"}]'::jsonb,'B','Teks menyebutkan "digital technology, such as sensors, automated controls, and advanced data analytics". Kontrol manual oleh operator adalah ciri khas dari sistem yang lebih tua, bukan smart grid.','BI',14);
