[Pertanyaan]: How does a smart grid benefit consumers?','[{"key": "A", "text": "It provides them with free electricity."}, {"key": "B", "text": "It automatically reduces their energy usage."}, {"key": "C", "text": "It disconnects them from the grid during peak hours."}, {"key": "D", "text": "It helps them track and manage their energy consumption."}]'::jsonb,'D','Teks menyatakan bahwa smart grid memungkinkan konsumen "to monitor their energy consumption in real-time," yang membantu mereka mengelola penggunaan.','BI',15);
