[Pertanyaan]: The word "evolution" in the first paragraph is closest in meaning to...','[{"key": "A", "text": "problem"}, {"key": "B", "text": "development"}, {"key": "C", "text": "decline"}, {"key": "D", "text": "rule"}]'::jsonb,'B','"Evolution" dalam konteks ini berarti sebuah perkembangan atau kemajuan dari kondisi sebelumnya. "Development" adalah kata yang paling sesuai.','BI',16);
  INSERT INTO public.questions (package_id,content,options,correct_answer,explanation,category,order_index) VALUES (pkg_id,'[Teks Bacaan]:
Problem-solving is a critical skill for any professional, especially in technical fields such as engineering and energy management. An effective problem-solving process typically involves several key stages. The first is to accurately define the problem, distinguishing symptoms from the root cause. Rushing this stage can lead to solutions that address the wrong issue.

Once the problem is clearly defined, the next stage is brainstorming potential solutions. This involves generating a wide range of ideas without initial judgment. After brainstorming, each potential solution must be evaluated based on criteria such as feasibility, cost, and potential impact. The chosen solution is then implemented and monitored to ensure it has effectively resolved the issue. This systematic approach ensures that challenges are addressed thoroughly and efficiently, minimizing the risk of recurrence.

[Pertanyaan]: What is the main subject of the passage?','[{"key": "A", "text": "The history of engineering."}, {"key": "B", "text": "A structured process for solving problems."}, {"key": "C", "text": "The importance of teamwork in brainstorming."}, {"key": "D", "text": "How to reduce costs in project management."}]'::jsonb,'B','Teks ini menguraikan tahapan-tahapan dalam proses pemecahan masalah, mulai dari mendefinisikan masalah hingga implementasi solusi.','BI',17);
